iv></div><h1 class=\"e8ezpv\" style=\"margin:0;font-size:34px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.6px\">Your sailing is forty minutes late.</h1><a class=\"ec97ab\" href=\"https://merrow.example/rebook\" style=\"align-self:flex-start;display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;color:#fff;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;text-align:center;box-sizing:border-box;padding:14px 24px;background-color:#c93a25;border-radius:2px\">Move me to the next sailing with the same cabin, at no extra charge, and send me the new times</a><a class=\"eqr2g3\" href=\"https://merrow.example/keep\" style=\"align-self:flex-start;display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;color:#fff;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;text-align:center;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;padding:14px 20px;background-color:#12242e;border-radius:2px\">Keep my booking and wait</a><p style=\"margin:0;color:#55636b;font-family:&#39;DM Mono&#39;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;font-size:12px\">Would a voucher for the café help?</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\"><a href=\"https://merrow.example/voucher/yes\" style=\"flex:0 1 120px;min-width:0;align-self:flex-start;display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;color:#fff;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;text-align:center;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px 0;background-color:#0f6a70;border-radius:2px\">Yes</a><a class=\"eqyvng\" href=\"https://merrow.example/voucher/no\" style=\"flex:0 1 120px;min-width:0;align-self:flex-start;display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;color:#12242e;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;text-align:center;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px 0;background-color:transparent;border:1px solid #12242e;border-radius:2px\">No thanks</a></div><a class=\"e431r5\" href=\"https://merrow.example/harbour-office\" style=\"align-self:flex-end;display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;color:#fff;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;text-align:center;box-sizing:border-box;padding:14px 24px;background-color:#55636b;border-radius:999px\">At the end, centred on phones</a></section></main></body></html>",
 "text": "Merrow Line\n\nButtons\n\nYOUR SAILING IS FORTY MINUTES LATE.\n\nMove me to the next sailing with the same cabin, at no extra charge, and send me the new times (https://merrow.example/rebook)\n\nKeep my booking and wait (https://merrow.example/keep)\n\nWould a voucher for the café help?\n\nYes (https://merrow.example/voucher/yes)\n\nNo thanks (https://merrow.example/voucher/no)\n\nAt the end, centred on phones (https://merrow.example/harbour-office)",
